  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Weapon (@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepMace000000]{Mace}), Rare (Requires Attunement)</p>\n<p>When you hit a Fiend or an Undead with this magic weapon, that creature takes an extra 2d6 Radiant damage. If the target has 25 Hit Points or fewer after taking this damage, it must succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw or be destroyed. On a successful save, the creature has the Frightened condition until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Light.</strong></em> While you hold this weapon, it sheds Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>midi-qol</strong>: Automates the extra 2d6 radiant damage against Fiends and Undead via a triggered damage activity. If the target has 25 HP or fewer after the radiant damage, a DC 15 WIS save is triggered. On failure, the target is destroyed (remaining HP dealt as untyped damage). On success, the Frightened condition is applied until end of the wielder's next turn. The Light property is not automated (use ATL or similar module).</p>",
      "chat": "<p>Weapon (@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepMace000000]{Mace}), Rare (Requires Attunement)</p>\n<p>When you hit a Fiend or an Undead with this magic weapon, that creature takes an extra 2d6 Radiant damage. If the target has 25 Hit Points or fewer after taking this damage, it must succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw or be destroyed. On a successful save, the creature has the Frightened condition until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Light.</strong></em> While you hold this weapon, it sheds Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet.</p>"
    },
